                        Enjoy safe and secure payment methods with reliable transaction protection.
                    </p>

                    <a href="@Url.Action("About", "Home")" class="cus-btn-2">
                        <span class="btn-text">Read More</span>
                        <span>About Us</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
